> You could try:
> =A0 OPTIONS=3D!autopickup
>
> or:
> =A0 OPTIONS=3Dnoautopickup
>
> The main thing is to make sure you have the "OPTIONS=3D" part at the
> beginning.
>
> Just FYI, you can also have multiple options on one line, like:
> =A0 OPTIONS=3Dautopickup,pickup_types:$,pickup_burden:u
>
> This turns autopickup for gold only, and only if it won't make you
> burdened (or worse).
